        <h2 class="section-heading">Benefits of Land-Use Planning</h2>
        <p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.6;">
            Sustaining environmental, economic, and social viability of communities requires planning—the collective and coordinated efforts of many individuals and organizations over time. As noted by planning scholar Tom Daniels, community planning seeks to serve the best interests of a community. It does not attempt to replace market forces of supply, demand,
        </p>
